<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT- CSFB, JP MORGAN ON NOKIA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- CSFB, JP MORGAN ON NOKIA.</headline>
<text>
<p>* CSFB says ups Nokia 1997 EPS estimate to 18.5 markka from 17.1 and 1998 EPS to 23 markka from 22.1. Rates stock &quot;buy&quot;.</p>
<p>* JP Morgan says rates &quot;buy&quot;, sets target price of 550 markka.</p>
<p>Nokia on Monday reported an slightly above-forecast H1 profit of 3.33 billion markka before tax and minorities.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
